Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: wireless: describe WCN7860 PCIe

The imported driver uses the same PMU output supplies as WCN7850.

---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/wireless/qcom,ath12k.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/wireless/qcom,ath12k.yaml
@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@
   compatible:
     enum:
       - pci17cb,1107  # WCN7850
+      - pci17cb,110e  # WCN7860
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
